This project implements the method described in:
  "Cartridges: Lightweight and general-purpose long context representations via self-study"
  Sabri Eyuboglu, Ryan Ehrlich, Simran Arora, Neel Guha, Dylan Zinsley, Emily Liu,
  Will Tennien, Atri Rudra, James Zou, Azalia Mirhoseini, Christopher Ré (2025).
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.06266

The self-study seed prompts in src/kvpack/seeds.py are adapted from the reference
implementation at https://github.com/HazyResearch/cartridges (Apache License 2.0).
